  "description": "Local deterministic OSS Manager QA planner and receipt evaluator with source locks, feature-owned suite validators, documentation-impact gates, typed operation contracts, fail-closed suite coverage, compensation-before-mutation, killed-run recovery, and restore-finally verdicts. Live infrastructure adapters are deployment-supplied and are not bundled.",
  "readiness": {
